    "Id": "vehicledef_DECURION",
    "Name": "Decurion CAV",
    "Details": "Developed in the 3030's the Decurion Hover Tank is a 45 ton command vehicle designed to lead a Light Vehicle Century. A 125-rated ICE gives the Decurion a top speed of 120km/h; fast enough to keep up with many lighter hover vehicles. 8 tons of armor ensure the tank will stand up to Mech scale weapons. Weapons wise the Decurion is armed with a Large Laser for ranged combat and a pair of Rocket Launcher 15's for closer range engagements.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: This unit can not deploy in Lunar or Martian biomes due to using an ICE.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 8/12 hexes / 240/360 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Armor\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       170     25\n<b>Left</b>         130     25\n<b>Right</b>       130     25\n<b>Rear</b>        100     25\n<b>Turret</b>      155     25\n\n<b>Total</b>      685    125</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Improved Targeting - Short</color>",
    "Icon": "Zephyr"
  },
